## Account rules

| Account | Annual interest | Overdraft | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| SAVINGS | 4% (credited monthly) | None | Balance cannot go below zero |
| CURRENT | None | Up to 5,000 | Can go negative within the overdraft limit |

## Design overview

```
            +-----------------+
            |      Bank       |  ---- notifies ---->  BankListener (console feed)
            |  accounts map   |
            |  undo stack     |
            +--------+--------+
                     | manages
          +----------+-----------+
          |                      |
   SavingsAccount          CurrentAccount
          \                      /
           +------ Account -----+
              deposit / withdraw
              monthly interest
              immutable ledger
```

## Ideas for extending the project

- Add a login system with hashed PINs
- Replace the CSV file with SQLite through JDBC
- Add a Swing or JavaFX graphical interface
- Add loan accounts with EMI calculation
- Write JUnit tests for interest rounding and rollback behavior
- Add an export of statements to PDF
- Connect the fraud watch to a configurable rules file

## Limitations

This is a learning project. It has no authentication, no concurrency control, and the CSV file is not encrypted. Do not use it to handle real money.

